//
// Copy to Developer.local.xcconfig, which Git ignores, and name the developer
// the Buy me tokens sheet shows: a name (shown as it is), and the handles of
// the GitHub and X profiles the two logo buttons open (the handle alone, never
// an address: a double slash starts a comment here, and the code builds the
// addresses). The avatar and the two logos are local files, never tracked:
//
//   Config/Local/developer-avatar.jpeg   the avatar, shown as a circle
//   Config/Local/github-logo.svg         GitHub's mark (one path)
//   Config/Local/x-logo.svg              X's mark (one path)
//
// Each piece is in an AppStore build only when its value and its file are
// there; every other build carries none of it. DeveloperExample/ holds drawn
// stand-ins the tests and screen captures use with the arrangement below.

DEVELOPER_NAME = example
DEVELOPER_GITHUB_HANDLE = example
DEVELOPER_X_HANDLE = example
